Lucide (icon font, crates/metal-dash/assets/lucide.ttf)
  ISC License (text: crates/metal-dash/assets/LUCIDE-LICENSE)
  https://lucide.dev
Geometry kernel — algorithms and API design studied; no source copied
  Blender (GPL-2.0-or-later)
    BMesh (source/blender/bmesh): the non-manifold B-rep, operator slots and
    per-op tool flags that inform metal-geom's pure ops.
    geometry/ (GEO_mesh_boolean, GEO_mesh_bevel, GEO_mesh_primitive_*,
    GEO_*_curves): the boolean contract (MeshArr/Float/Manifold solvers) and
    the curve-operation shortlist re-implemented in Rust.
    editors/space_view3d (navigation, camera control, gizmos, snapping): the
    interaction model for the viewport, re-implemented with egui.
  MetalVJ is AGPL-3.0-or-later; Blender is GPL-2.0-or-later. No Blender source
  is vendored. If any is ever vendored it must carry SPDX GPL-2.0-or-later
  headers and be isolated in its own crate.

manifold3d / Manifold — Apache-2.0 OR MIT — robust CSG kernel.
kurbo — Apache-2.0 OR MIT — 2D Bézier/spline geometry.
lyon — MIT OR Apache-2.0 — planned path tessellation.
transform-gizmo — MIT OR Apache-2.0 — planned 3D transform gizmo.
parry3d — Apache-2.0 — planned ray casting and BVH (verify at the pinned version).
gltf — Apache-2.0 OR MIT — glTF 2.0 import (crates/metal-geom/src/gltf.rs).

Venue assets
  Poly Haven — CC0. Imported assets record polyhaven_id/url/authors/
    resolution/licence.
  Poly Pizza — CC0 and CC-BY. CC-BY imports store and display the
    polypizza_attribution line.
  Sketchfab — per-model licence, recorded on import; no-licence models refused.
  Import is local only: MetalVJ has no HTTP client in the tree and does not
  fetch from these services at runtime. An asset is downloaded by the operator
  and imported from disk with its licence, author and URL recorded.
